+
+# Bulk import of tasks
+
+Request: a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, for teams moving from spreadsheets.
+
+- `text` holds one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`. The priority may be empty (normal); tags are separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list; the result is `{ imported, rejected }`, `imported` being the number of tasks added.
+- `rejected` lists each line that could not be added as `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1 (blank lines count).
+- A line is rejected for the list's own reasons (invalid title, priority or tag, duplicate title), or for having more than three fields. A rejected line changes nothing; the others are still imported.
diff --git a/src/domain/import.ts b/src/domain/import.ts
new file mode 100644
